ng some soda and if  you're curious just how many other  players cranberry will be leveling up  faster than the official Call of Duty  Twitter account revealed over 25 million  players played Warzone 2.0 in its first  five days of existence even compared to  Activision Blizzard's other games that  makes Warzone 2.0 a startling success  for example OverWatch 2 notched 25  million players in 10 days followed by  35 million players in one month  meanwhile Modern Warfare 2 continues to  be one of the most successful cards ever  with one billion dollars generated in  Revenue in 10 days it also sold faster  than any other game in Series history  are you one of the 25 million Warzone  2.0 players out there have you run into  any other glitches that we should be  aware of let us know in the comments  below and we'll see you next time for  more Gamespot news
 

